      "content": "I'm not sure I follow the analogies you're using. This is a very serious and technical procurement issue for our medical logistics team, so we need to keep the documentation strictly professional and data-driven. \n\nCan we get back to the technical causes? You mentioned air currents and vibrations, but could you provide more detail on how specific mechanical vibrations from transport vehicles might actually impact the internal thermal stability of the specialized packaging? Also, please omit any metaphorical comparisons in your next response so I can use this directly in our technical report.",
